# B: excursion to (0.4, -0.3) and back, then the camera-gated pad landing (gate 10 cm, fusion 3)
# Fly it: fly lab_b_land --once. Pass (PROPOSED): camera landing < 10 cm on 3 in a row (C landings count).
campaign lab-b-land
rate 50
log estimator_truth optical_flow velocity_loops takeoff_gate thrust_model ekf_states camera_fusion
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10
takeoff 0.5
hold 3
goto x=0.4 y=-0.3 z=0.5 dwell_s=3
hold 3
land
